   "subject": "Price adjustment from 01 January 2027",
   "text": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nwe have supplied Hollerau Pumpenwerke reliably for many years. Owing to the strong rise in copper and electronic component prices, we are forced to adjust our prices for Control board HB smart pump (PCBA) (part:350030) by **8.0 %** with effect from **01 January 2027**: from EUR 34.35 to EUR 37.10 per  pc.\n\nWe regret this step and ask for your understanding.\n\nYours faithfully,\nPlatinenwerk Lausitz GmbH"
  }
